# No VITE_API_URL is needed in this project.
# - Local development: the frontend falls back to http://localhost:3000 automatically.
# - Vercel (production): frontend and backend deploy together on one origin, so
#   relative '/api' paths are used automatically.
# Only set this if you ever host the backend on a different origin than the frontend:
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend.example.com
